{1}{[Before you stands a tall bookish man with spectacles perched on the top of his head. He is oblivious to your presence, as all of his attention is focused on the large tome he has open before him. Suddenly, he becomes aware of your presence and looks up.] Hmm, yes, what may I do for you?}{[Before you stands a tall bookish man with spectacles perched on the top of his head. He is oblivious to your presence, as all of his attention is focused on the large tome he has open before him. Suddenly, he becomes aware of your presence and looks up.] Hmm, yes, what may I do for you?}{}{}{}{ }
