{370}{Yes, yes, of course. You will have to excuse my excitement, I am new to this whole phrenology discipline. My colleague, professor Gershwin, is doing wonderful things in the field. By way of introduction, I am Professor Eakins, Scientician and Expert of Demonology.}{Yes, yes, of course. You will have to excuse my excitement, I am new to this whole phrenology discipline. My colleague, professor Gershwin, is doing wonderful things in the field. By way of introduction, I am Professor Eakins, Scientician and Expert of Demonology.}{}{}{}{gf2385 1 }
{371}{Scientician and demonologist? You're mixing magick and science?}{}{5}{ra-7}{380}{ }
{372}{Scientician and demonologist? You're mixing magick and science?}{}{5}{ra7}{450}{ }
{373}{I need information about L'anamelach.}{}{5}{gf2214 1}{40}{ }
{380}{I am a scholar, involved in research. Magick and science are the opposite sides of the same coin. To be truly knowledgeable, one must study a tremendous variety of things. Specialization is for insects and orcs.}{I am a scholar, involved in research. Magick and science are the opposite sides of the same coin. To be truly knowledgeable, one must study a tremendous variety of things. Specialization is for insects and orcs.}{}{}{}{ }
{381}{What can you tell me about demonology?}{}{5}{lf10 0}{390}{lf10 1 }
{382}{What can you tell me about your scientific endeavors?}{}{5}{lf11 0}{420}{lf11 1 }
{383}{I need information about L'anamelach.}{}{5}{gf2214 1}{40}{ }
{389}{I must be going. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{390}{Well, it concerns the study of demons, obviously. Heh. I was just thinking about a rather humorous one, actually. Name of Gorgoth.}{Well, it concerns the study of demons, obviously. Heh. I was just thinking about a rather humorous one, actually. Name of Gorgoth.}{}{}{}{ }
{391}{Can you tell me about it?}{}{5}{ra-6}{400}{ }
{392}{What can you tell me about your scientific endeavors?}{}{5}{lf11 0}{420}{lf11 1 }
{393}{Can you tell me about it?}{}{5}{ra6}{440}{ }
{394}{I need information about L'anamelach.}{}{5}{gf2214 1}{40}{ }
{399}{I must be going. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{400}{Gorgoth was a mindless demon, roaming the countryside. He had an insatiable appetite, and would eat anything he came across. And [he chuckles], this is the funny part, he happened upon a village of halflings and ate them all! It seems he had a sweet tooth for halflings! Hah! Isn't that great?}{Gorgoth was a mindless demon, roaming the countryside. He had an insatiable appetite, and would eat anything he came across. And [he chuckles], this is the funny part, he happened upon a village of halflings and ate them all! It seems he had a sweet tooth for halflings! Hah! Isn't that great?}{}{}{}{ }
{401}{Uh, I guess. What happened to him?}{}{5}{}{410}{ }
{402}{K:}{}{5}{}{430}{ }
{409}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{410}{Oh, he was banished to some other realm or some such nonsense. That's what they used to do with troublemakers back in those days.}{Oh, he was banished to some other realm or some such nonsense. That's what they used to do with troublemakers back in those days.}{}{}{}{ }
{411}{K:}{}{5}{}{430}{ }
{419}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{420}{I wish there were more to tell, actually. I am just scratching the surface of the new ways of scientificdom, such as my exploring of phrenology. Science will solve all the world's ills within fifty years, you know.}{I wish there were more to tell, actually. I am just scratching the surface of the new ways of scientificdom, such as my exploring of phrenology. Science will solve all the world's ills within fifty years, you know.}{}{}{}{ }
{421}{K:}{}{5}{}{430}{ }
{429}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{430}{Yes, what questions may I answer for you?}{Yes, what questions may I answer for you?}{}{}{}{ }
{431}{What can you tell me about your scientific endeavors?}{}{5}{lf11 0}{420}{lf11 1 }
{432}{What can you tell me about demonology?}{}{5}{lf10 0}{390}{lf10 1 }
{433}{I need information about L'anamelach.}{}{5}{gf2214 1}{40}{ }
{439}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{440}{Gorgoth was a mindless demon, roaming the countryside. He had an insatiable appetite, and would eat anything he came across. And [he chuckles], this is the funny part, he happened upon a village of halflings and ate them all! It seems he had a sweet tooth for...[he stops abruptly, perhaps realizing that you're a halfling.] Oh, uh, I suppose it wasn't that funny after all.}{Gorgoth was a mindless demon, roaming the countryside. He had an insatiable appetite, and would eat anything he came across. And [he chuckles], this is the funny part, he happened upon a village of halflings and ate them all! It seems he had a sweet tooth for...[he stops abruptly, perhaps realizing that you're a halfling.] Oh, uh, I suppose it wasn't that funny after all.}{}{}{}{ }
{441}{K:}{}{5}{}{430}{ }
{449}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{450}{I am a scholar, involved in research. Magick and science are the opposite sides of the same coin. To be truly knowledgeable, one must study a tremendous variety of things. Specialization is for insects and orcs..uh, I mean ogres. I am sorry, I meant no offense. A slip of the tongue, you see.}{I am a scholar, involved in research. Magick and science are the opposite sides of the same coin. To be truly knowledgeable, one must study a tremendous variety of things. Specialization is for insects and orcs..uh, I mean ogres. I am sorry, I meant no offense. A slip of the tongue, you see.}{}{}{}{ }
{451}{Quite alright. What can you tell me about your scientific studies?}{}{5}{lf11 0}{420}{lf11 1 }
{452}{Quite alright. What can you tell me about demonology?}{}{5}{lf10 0}{390}{lf10 1 }
{459}{I've never been so insulted in my entire life! Good day, sir!}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{460}{Have you dispatched that dreaded L'anamelach?}{Have you dispatched that dreaded L'anamelach?}{}{}{}{ }
{461}{Not yet, but I am working on it.}{}{5}{gf2249 0}{0}{ }
{462}{Yes, I did.}{}{5}{gf2249 1}{470}{ }
{470}{We all owe you our thanks, good sir.}{We all owe you our thanks, madam.}{}{}{}{lf25 1 }
{471}{It was nothing.}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 480}
{472}{I should say so.}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 480}
{480}{I will be getting back to my studies now, if you will excuse me.}{I will be getting back to my studies now, if you will excuse me.}{}{}{}{ }
